{"type":"fact","doc_id":"d2_doc0028","statement":"Query relevance ranking and sentence saliency ranking are the two main tasks in extractive query-focused summarization.","source_span":"Query relevance ranking and sentence saliency ranking are the two main tasks in extractive query-focused summarization."}
{"type":"fact","doc_id":"d2_doc0028","statement":"AttSum jointly learns query relevance ranking and sentence saliency ranking using a neural attention mechanism.","source_span":"proposes a novel summarization system called AttSum, which tackles the two tasks jointly"}
