{"type":"fact","doc_id":"d2_doc0029","statement":"The proposed alternative summarization evaluation metric is called SERA, which stands for Summarization Evaluation by Relevance Analysis.","source_span":"We call our metric SERA (Summarization Evaluation by Relevance Analysis)."}
